      "updated": 1785233672727,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> **Note**\n>\n> `chatHistory` is maintained by the frontend for the current browser session only.\n> It provides conversation context for follow-up questions and is sent with each `/api/chat` request.\n> No user authentication or database storage is required for the MVP. If the page is refreshed or a new repository is analyzed, the chat history is reset.",
      "fontSize": 47.169968809602416,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> **Note**\n>\n> `chatHistory` is maintained by the frontend for the current browser session only.\n> It provides conversation context for follow-up questions and is sent with each `/api/chat` request.\n> No user authentication or database storage is required for the MVP. If the page is refreshed or a new repository is analyzed, the chat history is reset.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
